                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/4130: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gibson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-09-15T20:00:00-03:00">September 15, 1934—8
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 8:30 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>225. My 224. After further conversation this afternoon I am authorized to say
                    that despite irritation and concern Brazil is in this mediation as long as [we?]
                    desire her cooperation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gibson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
